6.3 Other models

The catalog's Apache-2.0 and MIT models (Whisper, Moonshine English,
GigaAM, Granite Speech, Qwen3-ASR, Voxtral, Silero VAD, the ECAPA
language detector and others) are not redistributed by Wispr Bro: the
app downloads them unchanged from the handy-computer Hugging Face
repositories, which carry their licences. The 12 non-English Moonshine models (non-commercial, although
Handy's catalog says MIT) and models under non-commercial, NVIDIA Open
Model or "other" licences are never chosen silently (DEC-27); see the
register.

